# FPL official API needs no key — this file is placeholder for future optional integrations.

# Optional: FPL entry ID, only if tracking a real squad (not used in from-scratch mode)
# FPL_ENTRY_ID=

# Optional notification channels (alerts/engine.py) — the terminal channel always
# fires regardless; these add push delivery on top of it, both genuinely free:
#
# Telegram (message @BotFather on Telegram -> /newbot -> copy the token it gives you;
# then message your new bot once and fetch https://api.telegram.org/bot<TOKEN>/getUpdates
# to find your chat_id in the response):
# TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
# TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=
#
# Discord (a server you control -> Server Settings -> Integrations -> Webhooks ->
# New Webhook -> Copy Webhook URL):
# DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL=

# Optional: live pre-match odds blending (models/expected_points.py falls back to
# Dixon-Coles-only without this; devig/blend math lives in models/odds_devig.py
# and models/blend.py). Free tier, no credit card - 100 requests/day flat
# (2026-09-13: replaced the-odds-api.com, whose real free tier was 500 CREDITS
# PER MONTH, not per day - easy to blow through with any real sync cadence):
# 1. https://dashboard.api-football.com/register -> sign up with an email
# 2. Copy the API key from your dashboard
# 3. Paste it below (remove the leading #)
# API_FOOTBALL_KEY=
